  "name": "DevX Connector: GitHub pull request (Preview)",
  "description": "Demonstrates Template mode with Source GitHub using a pull_request webhook. Configure GitHub to POST pull_request events to /webhook/devx/github-pull-request; the connector extracts the action, title, repository, author, URL, and body into the github_pull_request template. Add a DevX Message Connector credential and configure DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL and DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_KEY. Use the Webhook test URL while editing, or activate the workflow and use its production URL in GitHub. Preview does not post to Teams; switch Mode to Send after reviewing the result.",
